  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b71cb9b45ea085d4c9b4e74e66463d8b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  storyPanel: {fileID: 1716383434}
  storyText: {fileID: 268257622}
  storyLines:
  - "Luna: Buras\u0131\u2026 h\xE2l\xE2 nefes al\u0131yor gibi.\r\nAma bo\u015Fluk..
    her \u015Feyi bo\u011Fmu\u015F."
  - "Aris: Bu ad\u0131m\u0131 tan\u0131r\u0131m\u2026\r\nLuna\u2026 ger\xE7ekten
    sen misin?"
  - "Luna: Aris!\r\nEvet\u2026 Ben Luna\u2019y\u0131m.\r\nKule \xE7\xF6kerken beni
    saklam\u0131\u015Ft\u0131n\u0131z.\r\nSizi burada bulaca\u011F\u0131m\u0131 biliyordum."
  - "Luna: Ona engel olmak i\xE7in geri d\xF6nd\xFCm.\r\nBu bo\u015Fluk hapishanesinden
    sizi kurtarmal\u0131y\u0131m."
  - "Aris: Malvaren\u2026\r\nH\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131n k\xF6lesi oldu.\r\nUstas\u0131n\u0131n
    I\u015F\u0131k Disiplini kitab\u0131n\u0131 \xE7ald\u0131\r\nve \xF6l\xFCms\xFCzl\xFC\u011F\xFCn
    kap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 zorlad\u0131."
  - "Aris\u2019:Rit\xFCel ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z oldu.\r\nBedenlerimiz yok edildi\u2026\r\nRuhlar\u0131m\u0131z
    par\xE7aland\u0131.\r\nZihnimin sessizli\u011Fi bile parampar\xE7a art\u0131k."
  - "Luna: Bu b\xF6yle kalmayacak.\nSizi buradan \xE7\u0131karaca\u011F\u0131m."
  lineDisplayTime: 2
